---
description: Fee tracker project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Project: coaching fee tracker and parent portal. Read PLAN.md before any task.
Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, Prisma + Postgres, Zod, jose JWT, Vitest.
Rules:
- Store all money as integer paise. Convert to rupees only for display.
- Business logic lives in /lib as pure functions with no framework imports, and every function there has Vitest tests.
- Never read today's date directly. Use getToday() from /lib/today.ts, which reads DEMO_TODAY from env, else the real date.
- Instalment status is derived, never stored.
- Validate every API input and form with Zod. Check the session role inside every route handler, not only in middleware.
- A parent can only access students linked to their own parentUserId.
- No secrets in code. Read them from process.env only. Do not log secrets or phone numbers.
- Every list and page needs loading, empty and error states. No dead buttons.
- UI: white background, one accent colour (indigo-600), red only for overdue, Inter + Noto Sans Devanagari, tap targets at least 48px, body text at least 16px, minimal clutter.
- All user-facing text goes through the i18n dictionaries (en and hi).
- Fully responsive. Parent pages: mobile-first at 360px, two-column layout from md. Accounts pages: designed for desktop, tables scroll sideways on small screens.
- Do not ask me questions. Make a reasonable choice, then list your assumptions at the end.
- Keep files small and readable. Prefer clear names over comments.